1
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:20,500
[ Japanese whisper voice included / Marshmallow Eating Sounds ]
[ Please wear headphones or earphones ]

2
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Hello everyone. This is Hatomugi.

3
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:34,000
Happy Halloween, everyone!

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,500
I hope you're all having a wonderful Halloween.

5
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,000
Today, after a long time...

6
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:56,500
I'm going to be eating these marshmallows.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:09,000
These are Seven Premium's Marshmallow Mix in a Halloween edition package.

8
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:25,500
The packaging features cute, colorful illustrations of bats, ghosts, and skeletons. It's such a lovely package, isn't it?

9
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:38,500
To get into the Halloween spirit, even just a little, I decided to pick up this Halloween-themed treat.

10
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,000
They look delicious. There are several different flavors included.

11
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:52,000
As for the flavors, we have Crunch Vanilla flavor...

12
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:56,000
Caramel flavor...

13
00:01:56,500 --> 00:02:04,500
Strawberry flavor, and Chocolate flavor—four varieties in total.

14
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:17,500
Flavors like Crunch Vanilla and Caramel are quite unusual for marshmallows, aren't they?

15
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:27,000
You don't see those very often. Strawberry marshmallows aren't sold in that many places either.

16
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:32,500
While I've eaten plenty of chocolate marshmallows before...

17
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,500
I haven't really tried the other three flavors, so I'm really looking forward to eating them.

18
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:51,500
In Japan, Halloween is often thought of as having a spiritual meaning similar to Obon...

19
00:02:52,500 --> 00:03:02,500
...but the image of "Trick or Treat"—"give me candy or I'll play a trick on you"—is very strong here.

20
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:13,000
So it definitely feels like an event where you hand out candy or receive candy from others.

21
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:24,500
This bag comes in a large quantity and is individually wrapped, probably so it can be handed out to kids.

22
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:32,000
It even says right here: "Fun individually wrapped treats to hand out!"

23
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:40,000
However, today I'll just be quietly eating them all by myself. I'm not sharing with anyone! (laughs)

24
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:48,500
That said, it's quite a lot, so I'll just eat what I can today...

25
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:56,500
...and since they're individually wrapped, I'll save the rest to enjoy on another day.

26
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,000
Now then, let's open the bag right away.

27
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:19,500
So cute! The individual wrappers inside are super cute too.

28
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:26,500
Look, the Caramel flavor has a bat ghost.

29
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:36,500
And the Strawberry flavor cream has a pink skeleton.

30
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:48,000
The Chocolate flavor wrapper is also a skeleton.

31
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:08,000
And the Crunch Vanilla flavor cream also features a bat ghost.

32
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:14,000
These are so adorable. You'd be so happy to receive even just one of these.

33
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:19,000
Now I'll open them up one by one.

34
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:27,500
I always wonder whether I should edit out the sound of cutting and opening the outer bag.

35
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:35,500
Some people say they really want to hear the crinkling sound of the bag when it opens...

36
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:45,500
...while others prefer the bag sounds to be cut out. It's always a tricky decision!

37
00:05:49,000 --> 00:06:03,000
My impression is that many viewers who watch chewing sound videos mainly come for the chewing sounds, so the opening part is usually kept short...

38
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:17,000
...or the food is already plated beforehand and there are no opening sounds at all.

39
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:25,500
Of course, some creators do show the entire unboxing process from the beginning.

40
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:36,000
I personally love the sound of bags and wrappers, so I really enjoy that unboxing part too.

41
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:45,000
However, for those who just want to hear the chewing sounds, the bag crinkling might feel a bit long or tedious.

42
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:55,000
Some might think, "Please hurry up and start eating!" I'm sure there are people who feel that way since I've been talking for quite a while now.

43
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:08,000
These are just impressions I've gathered from reading comments on my videos. How about all of you watching right now?

44
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:16,500
Do you prefer hearing the sounds of the bag opening, or do you prefer without them?

45
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:29,000
In my recent eating videos, I've had many videos where the bag sounds were mostly or completely cut out...

46
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:44,500
...so today, I decided not to cut the opening portion and include all the bag crinkles. Please enjoy the wrapper sounds!

47
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:57,500
Since there are four different flavors, I'll start by opening four of them.

48
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:05,000
I'll probably add more later because four definitely won't be enough! (laughs)

49
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:15,000
I've prepared this cute little plate, so I'll place them onto it.

50
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:21,500
First, the Crunch Vanilla Flavor Cream.

51
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:37,500
I'll open it near your right ear.

52
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:48,000
It smells so delicious and sweet!

53
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:55,500
I feel like eating it right now. I'll set it down on the plate.

54
00:08:58,500 --> 00:09:07,500
Next is the Strawberry Flavor Cream marshmallow. It's pink and so cute.

55
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:12,000
This time near your left ear.

56
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:24,000
Such a sweet aroma.

57
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:32,000
It looks slightly pinkish. I'll place it on the plate.

58
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Next is the Chocolate Flavor Cream.

59
00:09:56,500 --> 00:10:02,000
I'm so hungry right now, I just want to eat it right away.

60
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:14,000
And the last one is Caramel Flavor Cream.

61
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:35,500
The soft, squishy sound of marshmallows inside the bag is so nice.

62
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:55,500
Here they are! They look so fluffy, cute, and delicious.

63
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:03,500
I'm curious to see what the inside looks like, so I'll go cut them in half and be right back.

64
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:10,500
Here are the cross-sections of each flavor!

65
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Cutting them released so much fragrance—now I'm even hungrier!

66
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Caramel and chocolate look similar, but this middle one here is chocolate.

67
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:31,500
And this one at the bottom is the Crunch Vanilla flavor.

68
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:36,500
And this pink one is the strawberry flavor.

69
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:40,500
Which one should I start with?

70
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:53,000
I'm most curious about the Crunch Vanilla flavor marshmallow, so I'll try that one first.

71
00:11:56,500 --> 00:12:02,000
All right, let's taste the first one. Itadakimasu!

72
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:33,000
Delicious! It's a nice vanilla flavor.

73
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:41,000
Since it said "crunch," I thought it might be crispier...

74
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:51,000
...but the crunch pieces are very fine. There's no loud crunching sound, but you can feel the pleasant little grains inside.

75
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:58,000
I'll eat the other half. Crunch Vanilla flavor cream.

76
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:26,500
Yum! It's delicious.

77
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:29,000
I seem to lack vocabulary today! (laughs)

78
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:35,500
My drink for today is black iced coffee. I'll take a sip.

79
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:41,000
I used a special Halloween-themed skull glass.

80
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:53,500
Next up, let's try the Caramel flavor.

81
00:13:55,000 --> 00:14:02,000
Caramel Flavor Cream marshmallow. Itadakimasu.

82
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:28,000
Delicious! It feels slightly less sweet than the vanilla one.

83
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:32,000
Here's the second piece.

84
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:56,000
Next is the Strawberry Flavor.

85
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:04,500
Pink and very cute. Strawberry flavor, itadakimasu.

86
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:31,500
Delicious! It tastes like strawberry chocolate.

87
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:35,000
Eating the other half.

88
00:15:58,500 --> 00:16:02,000
Yum! And finally...

89
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:10,000
The Chocolate flavor. The most classic chocolate marshmallow. Itadakimasu.

90
00:16:30,500 --> 00:16:34,500
Having the second piece.

91
00:16:55,500 --> 00:17:07,000
All right, I've tried all four flavors! The one I personally found most delicious was...

92
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:16,000
The Chocolate flavor! (laughs) It might be the most standard choice, but chocolate is truly the best for me.

93
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:21,500
Strawberry was really tasty too—it's my second favorite.

94
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:34,500
Third place is tied between Vanilla Crunch and Caramel. Both were very good.

95
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:43,000
I've always loved chocolate the most. I prefer regular chocolate over strawberry chocolate...

96
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:53,000
...and over white chocolate or cream as well. That's why chocolate takes the #1 spot!

97
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:58,500
Now let me take another sip of coffee.

98
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:15,000
Because the straw is curly, it makes a little bubbling sound when I let go.

99
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:25,500
Four marshmallows were definitely not enough! So I'm going to have four more.

100
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:29,500
This time I'll open them as I eat.

101
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:35,500
First, the Crunch Vanilla Flavor Cream again.

102
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:40,000
Opening and eating it right away.

103
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:52,500
Itadakimasu.

104
00:19:55,500 --> 00:20:02,500
Next is the Caramel Flavor Cream.

105
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:14,500
Itadakimasu.

106
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:27,500
Next is Strawberry Flavor Cream.

107
00:22:00,500 --> 00:22:05,000
Itadakimasu.

108
00:23:16,500 --> 00:23:23,500
Chocolate Flavor Cream.

109
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:57,000
Itadakimasu.

110
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:23,500
Let me drink some coffee.

111
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:41,000
That was so good.

112
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:51,500
What should I do? There are still plenty left... Can I eat just two more?

113
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:55,000
I'll eat two more!

114
00:25:55,500 --> 00:26:01,000
Look how many are still left in the bag. It's really a big portion.

115
00:26:01,500 --> 00:26:15,000
The expiration date is November 30th, so I have about a whole month to finish them slowly.

116
00:26:15,500 --> 00:26:22,500
I'll close my eyes and pick blindly from the bag. Try to guess which one I pull out!

117
00:26:27,500 --> 00:26:30,000
Ta-da!

118
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:36,500
Caramel Flavor Cream! Did you guess right?

119
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:41,000
Let's draw one more.

120
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:53,500
Let me make a prediction too: Chocolate flavor!

121
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:58,000
Chocolate... chocolate... here it comes!

122
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:04,500
It's Strawberry Flavor Cream!

123
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:12,000
All right, I'll eat one Strawberry and one Caramel, and that will conclude today's video.

124
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:16,500
My guess was wrong! (laughs)

125
00:27:17,500 --> 00:27:21,500
Let's eat the Caramel Flavor Cream.

126
00:27:29,500 --> 00:27:32,500
Itadakimasu.

127
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:38,500
And the last one, Strawberry Flavor Cream.

128
00:28:38,500 --> 00:28:41,500
Itadakimasu.

129
00:29:47,500 --> 00:29:55,000
All done! I finished all of them.

130
00:29:55,500 --> 00:30:00,000
Gochisousama deshita! (Thank you for the treat!)

131
00:30:00,500 --> 00:30:06,000
Let me finish my coffee. My mouth is very sweet right now.

132
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:27,500
All the marshmallow flavors from Seven Premium were wonderfully delicious.

133
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:37,000
I hope you all get to enjoy some tasty marshmallows and have a lovely Halloween!

134
00:30:38,500 --> 00:30:43,000
Thank you so much for watching until the very end.

135
00:30:43,500 --> 00:30:47,500
I'll see you again in another video.

136
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:53,000
Good night, everyone.
